{
    "chapter_num": 3,
    "verses_count": 22,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Submission to Husbands"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Wives, likewise, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "be"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " submissive to your own husbands, that even if some do not obey the word, they, without a word, may be won by the conduct of their wives, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "when they observe your chaste conduct "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "accompanied"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " by fear. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Do not let your adornment be "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "merely"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " outward—arranging the hair, wearing gold, or putting on "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "fine"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " apparel— "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "rather "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "let it be"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the hidden person of the heart, with the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "imperishable"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "incorruptible "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "beauty"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " of a gentle and quiet spirit, which is very precious in the sight of God. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For in this manner, in former times, the holy women who trusted in God also adorned themselves, being submissive to their own husbands, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "as Sarah obeyed Abraham, calling him lord, whose daughters you are if you do good and are not afraid with any terror."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "A Word to Husbands"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Husbands, likewise, dwell with "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "them"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " with understanding, giving honor to the wife, as to the weaker vessel, and as "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "being"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " heirs together of the grace of life, that your prayers may not be hindered."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Called to Blessing"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Finally, all "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "of you be"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " of one mind, having compassion for one another; love as brothers, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "be"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " tenderhearted, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "be"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU humble"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "courteous; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "not returning evil for evil or reviling for reviling, but on the contrary blessing, knowing that you were called to this, that you may inherit a blessing. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "“He who would love life"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "And see good days,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "Let him"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "restrain"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "refrain his tongue from evil,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "And his lips from speaking deceit."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "Let him"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "turn away from evil and do good;"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "Let him seek peace and pursue it."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "For the eyes of the"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "are"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "on the righteous,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "And His ears"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "are open"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "to their prayers;"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "But the face of the"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "against those who do evil.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Suffering for Right and Wrong"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And who "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " he who will harm you if you become followers of what is good? "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But even if you should suffer for righteousness’ sake, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "you are"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " blessed. "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "“And do not be afraid of their threats, nor be troubled.”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 15,
                    "num_str": "15",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "set apart"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "sanctify "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU Christ as Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "the Lord God in your hearts, and always "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "be"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " ready to "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "give"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " a defense to everyone who asks you a reason for the hope that is in you, with meekness and fear; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 16,
                    "num_str": "16",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "having a good conscience, that when they defame you as evildoers, those who revile your good conduct in Christ may be ashamed. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 17,
                    "num_str": "17",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "it is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " better, if it is the will of God, to suffer for doing good than for doing evil."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Christ’s Suffering and Ours"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 18,
                    "num_str": "18",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For Christ also suffered once for sins, the just for the unjust, that He might bring "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU, M you"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "us to God, being put to death in the flesh but made alive by the Spirit, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 19,
                    "num_str": "19",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "by whom also He went and preached to the spirits in prison, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 20,
                    "num_str": "20",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "who formerly were disobedient, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU, M when the longsuffering of God waited patiently"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "when once the Divine longsuffering waited in the days of Noah, while "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "the"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " ark was being prepared, in which a few, that is, eight souls, were saved through water. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 21,
                    "num_str": "21",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "There is also an antitype which now saves us—baptism (not the removal of the filth of the flesh, but the answer of a good conscience toward God), through the resurrection of Jesus Christ, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 22,
                    "num_str": "22",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "who has gone into heaven and is at the right hand of God, angels and authorities and powers having been made subject to Him."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}